  "description": "Like Romeo and Juliet, beyond nationality, culture, religion and beliefs... what if different people could meet and fall in love? When a woman for the middle east who has little personal freedom meets with a Korean man with a lot of responsibilities, will they be able to understand each other and fight for their love against their parents' oppositions, and conservative social norms?\n\nThis webtoon was commissioned by the Korean International Trade Association.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://webtoon.daum.net/league/view/14273)  \n[Official English Translation](https://tapas.io/series/abudhabiromance/info)",
